# Website launch template

This is a template, not a project in progress. Its dates are relative: the project starts on the day someone starts it (`+0d`) and is due ten weeks later. When the template is started, every relative date becomes a real one, every ticket starts as ToDo, and every link points to the matching ticket in the new project.

Comments are lists, and lists are always copied, so this template has none. Anything written here would appear in every project started from it.

Project: Website launch|A new website, from the site map to launch day|+0d|+10w
    Tickets:
    * Agree the site map
        DueDate: +1w
    SubProjects:
    * Design|The look and feel of the new site
        Tickets:
        * Design the page layouts
            DueDate: +3w
            DependsOn:
            * [[Agree the site map]]
    * Build|Everything needed to run the new site
        Tickets:
        * Choose a hosting provider
            DueDate: +2w
        * Build the pages
            DueDate: +7w
            DependsOn:
            * [[Design the page layouts]]
            * [[Choose a hosting provider]]
        * Test on phones, tablets and computers
            DueDate: +8w
            DependsOn:
            * [[Build the pages]]
    * Launch|Telling people about the new site
        Tickets:
        * Write the launch announcement
            DueDate: +9w
        * Go live
            DueDate: +10w
            DependsOn:
            * [[Test on phones, tablets and computers]]
            * [[Write the launch announcement]]
